{"id":"vertrieben","lemma":"vertrieben","pos":"adj","rank":4816,"glosses":["expelled, dispelled, banished"],"ipa":"/fɛɐ̯ˈtʁiːbn̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/23/De-vertrieben.ogg/De-vertrieben.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich bin vertrieben worden.","en":"I've been evicted.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/391442","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"}]},{"text":"In diesem Geschäft wird kein Alkohol vertrieben.","en":"Liquor is not sold at this store.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"shop"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"no / not a"},{"g":"alcohol, ethanol"},null]},{"text":"Wir vertrieben uns die Zeit mit Kartenspielen.","en":"We killed time playing cards.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"card game","l":"Kartenspiel"}]},{"text":"Die Eingeborenen wurden von ihrem Land vertrieben.","en":"The native people were forced off their land.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"indigenous","l":"eingeboren"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"country"},null]},{"text":"Hier werden Dinge vertrieben, die sonst nirgendwo erhältlich sind.","en":"They sell things here that you can't get anywhere else.","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"to become"},{"g":"thing","l":"Ding"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"otherwise"},{"g":"nowhere"},{"g":"available, obtainable"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"}]}]}